'''Dogsville (Merciless)''' is an [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stage]] unlocked after clearing [[King Wahwah's Return]]. It was added in [[Version 9.4 Update|Version 9.4]] and appears on the '''5th''', '''6th''', '''19th''' and '''20th''' of every month. Upon completion, players have a 30% chance to unlock [[Rugby Cat (Rare Cat)|Rugby Cat]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

