==Trivia==
*Dogsville's Japanese name, WANLAND, is likely a reference to the famous host and television personality [[wikipedia:Roland (Japanese host)|ROLAND]], as [[King Wahwah]]'s Japanese description mentions that Everlord Wanwan is also a host.
*Prior to [[Version 9.6 Update|Version 9.6]], the English name of this stage said Insane despite the actual [[Stage Difficulties|difficulty]] being Merciless.
**Ironically, the exact same error happened with both of the stages in [[NEO Wanwan's Glory]], which was fixed in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]].
*Dogsville and [[N-1 Grand Prix (Deadly)|N-1 Grand Prix]] are the only initial [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stages]] to have restrictions.

